The residue-number-system arithmetic in src/fp/rns.rs, its generated tables in
src/fp/rns/parameters.rs, and the generator scripts/parameters.py follow VROOM:
Accelerating (Almost All) Number-Theoretic Cryptography Using Vectorization and
the Residue Number System, by Simon Langowski, Kaiwen He, and Srinivas Devadas.
https://eprint.iacr.org/2026/393

Reference implementation: VROOM, commit
013169524f701ec62f95048c427ccf9065da1abe.

The VROOM reference implementation's MIT license is reproduced in
LICENSE-VROOM. The Rust arithmetic, parameter generator, and SIMD kernels in
this crate are native implementations.
